    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4817e5a98e69421dcc3e33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王的意志十分坚定。作为训练员我很想尊重她的意志，\n但是该怎么做好呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1c68de939954ac5932b2497377b8750c1c5328013269668814d9a4d993407f",
